{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12106290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12106290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210629001:0":{"text":"다행이에요... 살았어요...","source_cn":"太好了……自由了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x085684A53794F5CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210629002:0":{"text":"이상하네, 아직도 몇 명이 모자라...","source_cn":"奇怪，人数对不上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE03A972F6AF1FC71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210629003:0":{"text":"물귀신이 마을 사람 몇 명을 데려갔는데, 어디로 데려갔는지 모르겠어요... 흑흑...","source_cn":"水鬼带走了几个姐妹，我也不知道他们往哪里去了……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE55F65F9B667C250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210629004:1":{"text":"울지 마, 돌아가는 길 알지?","source_cn":"别哭，你认识回去的路吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0CA060BACA1E95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210629005:0":{"text":"네! ","source_cn":"认识！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0CD5928B027F4E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210629006:1":{"text":"너 먼저 마을로 돌아가. 나머지 사람들은 우리가 찾으러 갈게. 반드시 구할 테니까 걱정하지 마!","source_cn":"你先回去，我们去找她们，一定会把人都救出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C65C482CF32F41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210629007:0":{"text":"네!","source_cn":"好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9A5C4DD3D858EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210629008:1":{"text":"이렇게나 넓은데, 어디로 가서 찾아야 할까요?","source_cn":"这里这么大，我们去哪里找呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3291504EACEC8785","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210629009:0":{"text":"이 근처에 물귀신의 영지가 하나 있어. 날 따라와.","source_cn":"水鬼在这附近还有一个营地，跟我来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD029BE796CD7D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民露娜":{"text":"루나","source":"村民露娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}